# Pivot Parlor — Cursor Rules

This file is deliberately short. The project guidance lives in the repo root and is kept current there:

- `CLAUDE.md` — architecture, commands, conventions, gotchas, secrets handling. Read it first.
- `AGENTS.md` — the graphite-first code-graph workflow for any non-trivial change.
- `ARAMID.md` — the security and quality gate that runs on commit and push. Never bypass it (`--no-verify`).

Do not add rules here; put them in `CLAUDE.md` so every agent sees the same source of truth.
